.TH KINTSUGI-HOOKS 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-hooks \- manage workspace hooks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi hooks
trust
.br
.B kintsugi hooks
list
.br
.B kintsugi hooks
status
.br
.B kintsugi hooks
untrust
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage workspace hooks. Hooks are scripts that run at specific points in the
agent lifecycle. Project hooks must be explicitly trusted before they run.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBtrust\fR
Allow this workspace's project hooks to run
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show operator and project hooks with trust state
.IP \fBstatus\fR
Show whether this workspace is trusted
.IP \fBuntrust\fR
Revoke this workspace's trust marker
.SH EXAMPLES
Check hook trust status:
.PP
  $ kintsugi hooks status
.PP
List all hooks:
.PP
  $ kintsugi hooks list
.PP
Trust project hooks:
.PP
  $ kintsugi hooks trust
.PP
Revoke trust:
.PP
  $ kintsugi hooks untrust
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
